# Item Detail Rebuild Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Turn item detail from an edit form into what the design specifies — a read-first view that shows how you actually wear a piece, with editing moved behind the `⋯` overflow.

